WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:03.810
Marcia amefungua duka lake jipya la kompyuta.

00:03.810 --> 00:07.480
Anatengeneza dola 27 kwenye kila kompyuta anayouza

00:07.480 --> 00:10.910
na matumizi yake kila mwezi ni dola 10,000.

00:10.910 --> 00:12.850
Idadi gani ndogo ya kompyuta

00:12.850 --> 00:15.410
anahitaji kuuza katika mwezi kutengeneza faida?

00:15.410 --> 00:17.975
Nitakuacha ufikirie hilo kwa muda kidogo.

00:17.975 --> 00:20.100
Hebu tufikirie nini tunatakiwa kutafuta.

00:20.100 --> 00:21.766
Tunatakiwa kutafuta idadi ndogo ya

00:21.766 --> 00:23.240
kompyuta anayotakiwa kuuza.

00:23.240 --> 00:25.770
Hebu tufanye mtajo

00:25.770 --> 00:26.660
utakaowakilisha hiyo.

00:26.660 --> 00:30.770
Hebu tufanye x ni sawa na idadi ya kompyuta atakazouza.

00:30.770 --> 00:36.220
Idadi ya kompyuta zitakazouzwa.

00:36.220 --> 00:38.250
Sasa, hebu tufikirie kiasi gani cha faida

00:38.250 --> 00:39.770
atakachotengeneza kwa mwezi.

00:39.770 --> 00:41.311
Na hicho ndicho tunachofikiria.

00:41.311 --> 00:43.660
Kompyuta ngapi, idadi ndogo

00:43.660 --> 00:45.570
anahitaji kuuza ili kutengeneza faida?

00:45.570 --> 00:48.770
Kwa hiyo nitaandika faida yake ni

00:48.770 --> 00:52.830
pesa kiasi gani anapata kutoka kwenye kuuza kompyuta.

00:52.830 --> 00:56.370
Na anatengeneza dola 27 kutoka kwenye kila kompyuta anayouza.

00:56.370 --> 01:00.870
Kwa hiyo faida yake itakuwa dola 27 mara namba ya kompyuta

01:00.870 --> 01:01.410
anazouza.

01:01.410 --> 01:05.550
Anapata $ 27 kwa kompyuta mara namba ya kompyuta anazouza.

01:05.550 --> 01:07.310
Lakini bado hatujamaliza.

01:07.310 --> 01:12.250
Bado ana matumizi ya dola 10000 kwa mwezi.

01:12.250 --> 01:17.860
Kwa hiyo tutatakiwa tutoe dola 10000.

01:17.860 --> 01:19.800
Tunachotakiwa kujali ni kutengeneza faida.

01:19.800 --> 01:25.530
Tunataka hii namba hapa iwe kubwa zaidi ya 0.

01:25.530 --> 01:28.000
Kwa hiyo tufikirie ni idadi gani ya kompyuta

01:28.000 --> 01:29.460
itatupatia 0.

01:29.460 --> 01:32.300
Na halafu, labda anatakiwa auze

01:32.300 --> 01:33.880
zaidi kidogo.

01:33.880 --> 01:36.180
Hebu tuone idadi gani itaimfikisha kwenye sehemu ya bila faida wala hasara.

01:36.180 --> 01:38.150
Kwa hiyo bila faida wala hasara -- hiyo ni faida 0.

01:38.150 --> 01:41.411
Sio hasi wala chanya -- ni sawa na 27 mara--

01:41.411 --> 01:42.910
na nitafanya zote kwa rangi moja sasa.

01:42.910 --> 01:46.300
27x kutoa 10,000.

01:46.300 --> 01:48.530
Tumeona milinganyo kama hii kabla.

01:48.530 --> 01:51.710
Tunaongeza 10,000 pande zote.

01:51.710 --> 01:56.890
Ongeza 10,000 pande zote, ili isiwepo

01:56.890 --> 01:58.610
upande wa kulia.

01:58.610 --> 02:03.630
Na tumebakiwa na 10,000.

02:03.630 --> 02:08.579
10000 ni sawa na 27x

02:08.579 --> 02:10.120
Na halafu kukokotoa x, tunatakiwa

02:10.120 --> 02:13.290
tugawanye pande zote kwa 27.

02:13.290 --> 02:13.910
Hebu tufanye hivyo.

02:13.910 --> 02:16.440
Gawanya pande zote kwa 27.

02:16.440 --> 02:18.580
Upande wa kulia, tuna x.

02:18.580 --> 02:20.070
Ngoja niiandike hii chini.

02:20.070 --> 02:24.110
Kwa hiyo tuna x upande wa kulia ambayo ni sawa na

02:24.110 --> 02:29.190
10000/27.

02:29.190 --> 02:31.890
Nimebadilisha upande wa kulia na wa kushoto hapa.

02:31.890 --> 02:33.140
Sasa, hii itakwenda kuwa sawa na ngapi?

02:33.140 --> 02:35.800
Tutafanya kugawanya kwa njia ndefu kupata jibu.

02:35.800 --> 02:39.950
Kwa hiyo 27 inaingia kwa 10000.

02:39.950 --> 02:41.490
Kwa hiyo 27 haingii kwa 1.

02:41.490 --> 02:42.340
Haingii kwa 10.

02:42.340 --> 02:45.080
Inaingia kwa 100 mara 3.

02:45.080 --> 02:48.754
3 mara 27 ni ngapi?

02:48.754 --> 02:51.556
81.

02:51.556 --> 02:55.410
100 kutoa 81 ni 19.

02:55.410 --> 02:58.230
Halafu tunashusha 0.

02:58.230 --> 03:00.332
27 inaingia kwa 190?

03:00.332 --> 03:02.877
Inaonekana kama itaingia mara sita.

03:02.877 --> 03:03.960
Hebu tuone kama hiyo ni sawa.

03:03.960 --> 03:06.330
6 mara 7 ni 42.

03:06.330 --> 03:08.220
6 mara 2 ni 12.

03:08.220 --> 03:10.558
Jumlisha 4.

03:10.558 --> 03:11.420
16.

03:11.420 --> 03:16.620
Hebu tuone, 90 kutoa 62 ni 28.

03:16.620 --> 03:18.110
Ngoja nirudi nyuma.

03:18.110 --> 03:19.870
Kwa hiyo inaingia mara 7.

03:19.870 --> 03:22.470
7 mara 7 ni 49.

03:22.470 --> 03:25.020
7 mara 2 ni 14.

03:25.020 --> 03:26.260
Jumlisha 4 ni 18.

03:26.260 --> 03:27.030
Hapo ni sawa.

03:27.030 --> 03:27.950
Angalia.

03:27.950 --> 03:30.090
Kwa hiyo 190 kutoa 189.

03:30.090 --> 03:31.820
Tunapata 1.

03:31.820 --> 03:33.820
Hebu tushushe 0 nyingine.

03:33.820 --> 03:36.705
Tunashusha 0 nyingine.

03:36.705 --> 03:38.900
Tuna 0 hapa.

03:38.900 --> 03:42.182
27 inaingia kwa 10 mara ngapi?

03:42.182 --> 03:43.640
Haingii kawa 10.

03:43.640 --> 03:45.250
Kwa hiyo tutaweka 0 hapa.

03:45.250 --> 03:48.450
0 mara 27 ni 0.

03:48.450 --> 03:50.020
Tunatoa.

03:50.020 --> 03:52.210
Na halafu tunapata 10 tena.

03:52.210 --> 03:54.220
Na sasa tuko kwenye sehemu ya desimali.

03:54.220 --> 03:56.400
Au tutaanza kupata nafasi za desimali.

03:56.400 --> 03:57.695
Tunaweza kushusha 0 nyingine.

03:57.695 --> 04:01.560
Tunapata 27 inaingia kwa 100 mara tatu.

04:01.560 --> 04:07.288
Kwa hiyo thamani yetu ya x inaenda kukadiriwa sawa na 370.3.

04:07.288 --> 04:10.340
Na tunaweza kuendelea kuongeza nafasi za desimali.

04:10.340 --> 04:13.760
Lakini hii inatosha kujibu swali letu.

04:13.760 --> 04:15.630
Ni idadi gani ndogo ya kompyuta

04:15.630 --> 04:19.019
anahitaji kuuza kwa mwezi kutengeneza faida?

04:19.019 --> 04:21.570
Hawezi kuuza sehemu

04:21.570 --> 04:23.750
